# Design mode

Default outputs: **visual assets and documents** — not production backend unless explicitly requested.

## Deliverable types

| Type | Primary skill | Output |
|------|---------------|--------|
| Investor pitch | `pitch-deck-architect` → `presentation-architect` | outline + `outputs/pitch/deck.pptx` |
| Consulting / strategy | `management-consultant-deck` → `presentation-architect` | storyline + pptx |
| Business PowerPoint | `presentation-architect` | `outputs/*.pptx` via PPTXGenJS |
| Social carousel | `carousel-architect` | `outputs/carousel/*.png` |
| Demo video / launch trailer | `demo-video-remotion` → `vinayak-remotion-video` → `remotion-best-practices` | Remotion + MP4 |
| UI polish | `impeccable` | audit + CSS fixes |

## Pipeline default

```text
Markdown → structure → layout → design tokens → generate (PPTX / PNG / Remotion)
```

## Brand

For Stamped Energy or Content OS work, read the matching file in `design-systems/` before choosing colors and typography.

Save work under `outputs/` unless the user specifies a project path.

## Presentation quality

Before delivering any deck, apply `.cursor/rules/presentation-quality-gates.mdc` and [business-deck-standards](../skills/presentation-architect/references/business-deck-standards.md). Playbook: [docs/PRESENTATION_PLAYBOOK.md](../../docs/PRESENTATION_PLAYBOOK.md).
